                    "a": "We Pakistanis are very fun loving people. We celebrate many festivals.\n\nMohan and Sita celebrate Divali. They celebrate Divali on the 27th of Asoo. It is on the 1st of November this year. They wear new clothes. They go for puja. They light clay lamps in their homes. They enjoy themselves with dancing and fire works. They wish 'Happy Divali' to their relatives and friends. They give gifts and sweets to each other."
