                "q": "(A) Express the fractions of coloured parts of the given figures numerically.\n(1) A square divided into 4 triangles; 1 triangle is coloured.\n(2) A rectangle of 10 parts; 7 parts are coloured.\n(3) A triangle divided into 3 parts; 2 parts are coloured.\n(4) A rectangle of 7 strips; 3 strips are coloured.\n(5) A grid of 12 parts; 5 parts are coloured.\n(6) A strip of 7 triangles; 5 triangles are coloured.",
