                "q": "(A) Solve the following:\n(1) 67 cm\n+ 21 cm\n(2) 37 m\n+ 85 m\n(3) 28 km\n+ 15 km\n(4) 11 m 33 cm\n+ 1 m 41 cm\n(5) 8 m 68 cm\n+ 6 m 31 cm\n(6) 35 km 515 m\n+ 12 km 436 m",
