                "a": "(1) 81 cm\n− 42 cm\n= 39 cm\n(2) 48 km\n− 19 km\n= 29 km\n(3) 26 m\n− 8 m\n= 18 m\n(4) 39 km 80 m\n− 17 km 48 m\n= 22 km 32 m\n(5) 44 km 72 m\n− 26 km 50 m\n= 18 km 22 m\n(6) 58 km 465 m\n− 29 km 287 m\n= 29 km 178 m"
