                "a": "(1) 76 cm − 36 cm = 40 cm\n(2) 12 m − 9 m = 3 m\n(3) 95 km − 88 km = 7 km\n(4) 680 m − 494 m = 186 m\n(5) 936 km 324 m − 864 km 150 m = 72 km 174 m"
